      432,
      "The Ban Is Announced\n\nHR Director clicks a remote, changing the presentation slide to a bold title: 'COMPANY CONDUCT POLICY'. The room is dead silent. HR：「Effective immediately, office relationships are strictly prohibited.」 Sophie sitting at the conference table, staring forward with a tense, frozen expression while pretending to take notes. HR：「Any violation will be treated as a disciplinary matter.」 Chloe leans over slightly, whispering behind her hand to Sophie who sits stiffly, eyes locked forward. Chloe：「Harsh. Who did they catch this time?」 Sophie answers quietly without turning her head, her hand tightly gripping her metallic pen. Sophie：「...No idea.」 The Manager sits two seats down, staring fixedly at the screen with a completely blank expression. The Manager：「Eyes on the slide, everyone.」 Sophie looks down at her tablet, her chest rising and falling as she swallows hard, feeling the weight of his cold demeanor. Sophie：「He didn't even look at me. Good. That's good.」",
